Placeholder so `COPY graphhopper/graph-dist/` in graphhopper/Dockerfile has
something to copy when GRAPH_SOURCE=none — a COPY of a missing path fails the
build outright.

scripts/publish_graph.sh --local fills this with a completed graph-cache/.
Its contents are gitignored: a routing graph is hundreds of megabytes and is
reproducible from scripts/graphhopper.sh.
